{
  "_about": "Soundcore test vectors from the owner's Space A40 (A3936), recorded with the Soundcore app (data/soundcore/reports/A3936_06.43.txt). Every implementation should reproduce them byte for byte. Frames: the full frame for each recorded command and body. a3936_state: the recorded state body and what it decodes to (sizes in docs/soundcore/PROTOCOL.md section 6). eq_smoothing: a curve in tenths of a dB and the smoothed bytes the app sends with it. eq_writes: 0387 bodies to rebuild from the state's HearID data and the curve. openscq30_states: state replies from OpenSCQ30's tests (github.com/Oppzippy/OpenSCQ30, GPL-3.0-or-later), many from its users' bug reports, with serial numbers replaced by zeros; each must fit its model's state layout. openscq30_eq: OpenSCQ30's EQ tests (github.com/Oppzippy/OpenSCQ30, GPL-3.0-or-later): a state reply with its serial numbers zeroed, a preset by OpenSCQ30's key or eight custom bands in tenths of a dB, and the packets it must send. openscq30_eq_formats: its tests of the shared EQ packets, with the inputs written out and the expected frame or body.",
